{"id":"b664bed1223db216","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-elementary-diagram.md","title":"Elementary Diagram","display":"df-elementary-diagram — Elementary Diagram","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-elementary-diagram","aliases":["17-df-elementary-diagram"],"display":"df-elementary-diagram — Elementary Diagram","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-df-diagram]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"2.2; 3.1","source_result":"Elementary-diagram convention in Proposition 2.2.17(c); explicit definition before Proposition 3.1.3","source_pages_print":[85,137],"source_pages_djvu":[101,153],"source_verification":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; canonical named expansion retained","source_verification_history":["not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"],"legacy_label":"17-df-2.1.3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-elementary-diagram"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-elementary-diagram</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-diagram — Elementary Diagram"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2; 3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Elementary-diagram convention in Proposition 2.2.17(c); explicit definition before Proposition 3.1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>85</span><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>101</span><span>153</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; canonical named expansion retained"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-2.1.3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>；规范命名扩张及其语言取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(L(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (language naming the carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> (canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(L(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span>-expansion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (truth in a structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemDiag}\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}\\)</span> (set defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}:\n\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\models\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n=\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}:\n\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\models\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Unlike the ordinary diagram in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>, the elementary diagram contains\nevery <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(L(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span>-sentence true in the canonical expansion, not only atomic\nand negated atomic sentences.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；规范命名扩张及其语言取 [[17-df-diagram]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L(\\mathfrak{A})$ (language naming the carrier, see [[17-df-diagram]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}$ (canonical $L(\\mathfrak{A})$-expansion, see [[17-df-diagram]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}$ (sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models$ (truth in a structure, see [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Unlike the ordinary diagram in [[17-df-diagram]], the elementary diagram contains\nevery $L(\\mathfrak{A})$-sentence true in the canonical expansion, not only atomic\nand negated atomic sentences.","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L(\\mathfrak{A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}","display":false},{"tex":"L(\\mathfrak{A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(